Package: crown
Title: Cluster-Randomized Trial Analysis with Outcomes Weighted for Nonresponse
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Brian", "Richardson", email = "richabr@wfu.edu", role = "aut"),
    person("zhitanhe", email = "zhitanhe@unc.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Description: Estimates population causal risks and contrasts using trial and
    auxiliary data. Provides parametric G-formula, inverse probability weighting,
    augmented inverse probability weighting, and cross-fitted double machine
    learning with XGBoost or SuperLearner nuisance regressions.
